    {
      "_id": "pLODJdArHu9Qm0NN",
      "name": "觸鬚Tentacles",
      "type": "weapon",
      "system": {
        "source": {
          "custom": "",
          "book": "MM'14",
          "page": "172",
          "license": "",
          "rules": "2014",
          "revision": 1
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--3\"><p><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">近戰武器攻擊：</em>命中[[/r 1d20+4]]{+4}，觸及10尺，單一目標。<em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style:normal\">命中：</em>7（[[/damage 1d10 + 2 type=piercing]]）點傷害。目標必須進行一次[[/save ability=con dc=11]]的豁免，豁免失敗者將陷入1分鐘的&amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]{中毒}狀態。該&amp;Reference[condition=poisoned]{中毒}目標同時陷入&amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed]{麻痹}狀態，並且可以在每個其自己回合結束時再進行一次該豁免，豁免成功則終止該效應。</p><p>目標同時還陷入&amp;Reference[condition=grappled]{擒抱}狀態（逃脫DC 15）。若目標爲中型或更小體型，則目標同時陷入&amp;Reference[condition=restrained]{束縛}狀態直至擒抱終止。觸鬚怪擒抱目標時，它對目標發動的所有攻擊檢定都具有優勢，且不能再對其他目標進行觸鬚攻擊。觸鬚怪移動時，受其擒抱的所有中型或更小體型的目標都將隨它一同移動。</p><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> [[/r 1d20+4]]{+4} to hit, reach 10 ft., one creature. <em>Hit:</em> 7 ([[/damage 1d10 + 2 type=piercing]]) damage, and the target must succeed on a [[/save ability=con dc=11]] saving throw or be &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] for 1 minute. The &amp;Reference[condition=poisoned] target is &amp;Reference[condition=paralyzed], and it can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on a success.</p><p>The target is also &amp;Reference[condition=grappled] (escape DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>). If the target is Medium or smaller, it is also &amp;Reference[condition=restrained] until this grapple ends. While grappling the target, the grell has advantage on attack rolls against it and can 't use this attack against other targets. When the grell moves, any Medium or smaller target it is grappling moves with it.</p></div>",
          "chat": ""
        },
